 "about": "Box types and their odds. Each box lists rows; weight is out of 10000 and the weights of a box must add up to exactly 10000. prize: cosmetic, artifact, gold (amount = gold), money (amount = cash in the reference economy), profileCard or companyCard. Prices live in pricing/prices.json. Paid boxes may not hold more than 5 percent cash and must return less gold than their price (a test checks this); gold and cash only sit in common and rare rows, the rarest rows are cosmetics. Boxes mirror the card packs: Basic (cabinet), Premium (grand) and Elite, the dearest box with the best odds. event1 to event6 are the six event box slots: their titles, art and exclusive epic and legendary items come from boxes/events.json and change every rotation. theme: optional look theme id from Content/themes/item_themes.json (default classic); a themed box drops items of its theme. The box ids are fixed; their odds and titles are free to change.",
